// Halcyon: one against one at the wall of a besieged city. The city's base
// is inside it (the rail yards north of the old town), the besieger's outside
// on the quarry hill at the end of the highway. One gate and two breaches go
// through the wall, and shells open more: every building in the city comes
// down. A grey afternoon under broken cloud; skirmish set-up can override the
// weather and the time of day.
